<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Nerd-Fonts on NavyD 的个人博客</title><link>/tags/nerd-fonts/</link><description>Recent content in Nerd-Fonts on NavyD 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 11:02:49 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/tags/nerd-fonts/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>如何使用 scoop 安装字体</title><link>/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 Aug 2025 16:03:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/</guid><description>&lt;!-- prettier-ignore --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在使用 scoop 安装字体
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/matthewjberger/scoop-nerd-fonts"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;nerd-fonts&lt;/a&gt;
后尝试更新时总是会遇到字体文件无法访问的问题 &lt;!-- markdownlint-disable-next-line MD013 --&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Copy-Item : The process cannot access the file 'C:\Users\navyd\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Windows\Fonts\CaskaydiaCoveNerdFont-BoldItalic.ttf' because it is being used by another process.&lt;/code&gt;
，与
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/matthewjberger/scoop-nerd-fonts/issues/271"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Updating font fails on Windows 10 (21H2) #271&lt;/a&gt;
中的描述一致。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="分析"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;分析
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;由于之前是 scoop 全局安装的字体，不使用用户级字体安装原因参考
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/matthewjberger/scoop-nerd-fonts/issues/198#issuecomment-1488996737"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Weird behavior for installed fonts after Windows 11 22H2 update #198&lt;/a&gt;
，并且 scoop 目前已经可以在用户目录正常安装字体，不再需要管理员权限！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在这里直接尝试使用 scoop 移除字体时发现字体被许多程序占用，无法卸载！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; gsudo scoop update -gf SarasaGothic-SC
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;SarasaGothic-SC: 1.0.32 -&amp;gt; 1.0.32 (global)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Updating one outdated app:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Updating &amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; (1.0.32 -&amp;gt; 1.0.32)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Downloading new version
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Loading Sarasa-TTF-1.0.32.7z from cache.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Checking hash of Sarasa-TTF-1.0.32.7z ... ok.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Running pre_uninstall script...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; Error
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; Cannot uninstall &amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; font.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; Reason
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; The &amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; font is currently being used by another application,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; so it cannot be deleted.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; Suggestion
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; Close all applications that are using &amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; font (e.g. vscode),
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; and then try again.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="检查占用字体句柄的进程"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e6%a3%80%e6%9f%a5%e5%8d%a0%e7%94%a8%e5%ad%97%e4%bd%93%e5%8f%a5%e6%9f%84%e7%9a%84%e8%bf%9b%e7%a8%8b" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;检查占用字体句柄的进程
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;使用 windows 资源监视器查看什么进程打开了这些字体。经过简单的测试发现，如果在
&lt;code&gt;windows terminal&lt;/code&gt;
中未包含中文字体时不会打开相关的中文字体句柄，首次出现中文字符才会打开相关字体句柄。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830190510.png"
width="891"
height="593"
srcset="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830190510_hu_7020d43db2cab685.png 480w, /posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830190510_hu_1a59cb14586c065.png 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="search handles in resource monitor"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="150"
data-flex-basis="360px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;微软官方应用
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sysinternals/downloads/process-explorer"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Process Explorer&lt;/a&gt;
（安装命令 &lt;code&gt;winget install Microsoft.Sysinternals.ProcessExplorer&lt;/code&gt;
注意重启终端后执行命令 &lt;code&gt;procexp&lt;/code&gt;）也可以查看文件句柄。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250831104858.png"
width="786"
height="593"
srcset="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250831104858_hu_b79b7909fad6c18f.png 480w, /posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250831104858_hu_ca9d04f6b9402a52.png 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="search handles in process explorer"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="132"
data-flex-basis="318px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;另外还可以使用
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://systeminformer.com/"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;System Informer&lt;/a&gt;
查看打开文件句柄的进程，响应更快。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830182325.png"
width="811"
height="593"
srcset="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830182325_hu_15a1e5e82a972678.png 480w, /posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830182325_hu_8bac471d094f3755.png 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="search handles in system informer"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="136"
data-flex-basis="328px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;注意：这 2 个应用要显示子进程树形列表可以点击 &lt;code&gt;Process&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Name&lt;/code&gt;
列来切换显示方式，参考
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/winsiderss/systeminformer/discussions/1091#discussioncomment-1953197"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;filtering multiple same processes to single process #1091&lt;/a&gt;
。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;可以发现有许多进程如 &lt;code&gt;chrome&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;obsidian&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;windows terminal&lt;/code&gt;
等常用的应用都在使用这个字体，需要手动关闭这些进程，但棘手的是
&lt;code&gt;windows terminal&lt;/code&gt;
作为系统自带的终端，执行 powershell 等 CLI 命令需要在终端执行，这就不可能执行 scoop 卸载命令前关闭
&lt;code&gt;windows terminal&lt;/code&gt; ，这是个死循环！！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;参考
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/matthewjberger/scoop-nerd-fonts/issues/271#issuecomment-1825913674"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;Updating font fails on Windows 10 (21H2) #271&lt;/a&gt;
提到需要使用额外的终端软件运行 scoop 命令即可。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note that updating the font from a console which uses the font still failed
with the same error. I think this is expected. I just had to start a cmd.exe
or another shell not using that font, and then the update went through without
error. Similar to when updating pwsh or WindowsTerminal, I&amp;rsquo;ll have to keep an
eye out using &lt;code&gt;scoop status&lt;/code&gt; when there is an update to the font, and update
it in another shell instead of the one I use normally which uses the font.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;注意：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;目前执行 &lt;code&gt;cmd.exe&lt;/code&gt; 会启动 &lt;code&gt;windows terminal&lt;/code&gt; ，需要安装第三方终端如
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/alacritty/alacritty"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;alacritty&lt;/a&gt;
以避免使用需要移除的字体文件。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;在执行 scoop 卸载命令前需要关闭所有使用相关字体的进程。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;执行卸载命令并安装字体到用户目录&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;19
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;20
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;21
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;22
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;23
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;24
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; gsudo scoop uninstall -g SarasaGothic-SC
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Uninstalling &amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; (1.0.32).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Running pre_uninstall script...done.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Running uninstaller script...The &amp;#39;Sarasa-Gothic&amp;#39; Font family has been uninstalled and will not be present after restarting your computer.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;done.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Unlinking C:\ProgramData\scoop\apps\SarasaGothic-SC\current
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (1.0.19).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (1.0.25).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (1.0.28).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (1.0.30).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (_1.0.32.old).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (_1.0.32.old(1)).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Removing older version (_1.0.32.old(2)).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;&amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; was uninstalled.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; scoop install SarasaGothic-SC
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Installing &amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; (1.0.32) [64bit] from &amp;#39;spc&amp;#39; bucket
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Loading Sarasa-TTF-1.0.32.7z from cache.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Checking hash of Sarasa-TTF-1.0.32.7z ... ok.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Extracting Sarasa-TTF-1.0.32.7z ... done.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Running pre_install script...done.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Running installer script...done.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Linking ~\scoop\apps\SarasaGothic-SC\current =&amp;gt; ~\scoop\apps\SarasaGothic-SC\1.0.32
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;&amp;#39;SarasaGothic-SC&amp;#39; (1.0.32) was installed successfully!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;在成功卸载全局的相关字体重启后，尝试使用用户级目录安装字体时发现&lt;code&gt;~\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Windows\Fonts&lt;/code&gt;
存在许久之前已安装的字体，尽管 scoop 安装过程中出现 &lt;code&gt;Copy-Item&lt;/code&gt;
访问错误但最后提示命令成功执行，与开头提到的问题一样，这就导致了一个问题，scoop 更新的字体版本与实际 windows 上安装的字体版本不一致，系统仍然在更新前的老版本（注意这里的截图是
&lt;code&gt;1.0.32&lt;/code&gt; 与 scoop 安装的一致，但实际更新出错时系统不会更新字体版本）。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830193355.png"
width="707"
height="526"
srcset="/posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830193355_hu_c37bbe1ca47900b5.png 480w, /posts/2025/08/how-to-install-fonts-using-scoop/20250830193355_hu_f5ef603c78effae7.png 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="show font version in sys settings"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="134"
data-flex-basis="322px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在使用 &lt;code&gt;scoop install SarasaGothic-SC&lt;/code&gt;
安装的字体后会导致卸载失败，重启后相关文件仍然存在！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 13
